# Copy to signup.properties (untracked) to let the app register accounts on a
# site whose `invite_code` site setting is set.
#
# Discourse checks this against `SiteSetting.invite_code`; anyone holding it can
# register from anywhere, so it belongs out of the repository — and it is still
# readable in the APK, which is the honest limit of what it buys.
# Leave it unset and the app simply does not send the field.
inviteCode=
